       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "28040436"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Homodimer (PubMed:28040436). Component of the tRNA-splicing ligase core complex composed of the catalytic subunit RTCB and the accessory proteins DDX1, C2orf49/Ashwin/ASW, FAM98B and RTRAF/CGI-99 (PubMed:21311021, PubMed:24870230). Interacts with FAM98A (PubMed:28040436)"
